<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>北溪厝龍安宮 - 2026太子文化祭 Q版香包平面生產稿</title>
<style>
    body { 
        background-color: #e9ecef; 
        display: flex; 
        justify-content: center; 
        align-items: center; 
        height: 100vh; 
        margin: 0; 
        font-family: '微軟正黑體', 'PingFang TC', sans-serif; 
    }
    .artboard { 
        background-color: #ffffff; 
        width: 600px; 
        height: 800px; 
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); 
        position: relative; 
        padding: 20px; 
        box-sizing: border-box; 
    }
    .info-panel { 
        position: absolute; 
        top: 30px; 
        left: 30px; 
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); 
        padding: 15px 25px; 
        border: 2px solid #333; 
        font-size: 14px; 
        border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .info-panel h3 { margin-top: 0; color: #d35400; }
    .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;}
    .line-box { width: 40px; height: 0; border-top: 3px dashed; margin-right: 15px; }
    .die-cut { border-color: #FF007F; }
    .safe-margin { border-color: #00FFFF; }
    svg { display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="artboard">
    <div class="info-panel">
        <h3>生產規格確認單</h3>
        <p><strong>專案名稱：</strong> 2026太子文化祭 - 刺繡香包</p>
        <p><strong>成品尺寸：</strong> 75 mm (寬) x 110 mm (高)</p>
        <p><strong>加工材質：</strong> 滿版刺繡、金線鎖邊</p>
        <p><strong>色彩模式：</strong> CMYK 純色塊 (無漸層)</p>
        <hr>
        <div class="legend-item"><div class="line-box die-cut"></div> 外圍刀模線 (Die-cut line)</div>
        <div class="legend-item"><div class="line-box safe-margin"></div> 安全範圍 (Safe Margin)</div>
    </div>

    <svg viewBox="0 0 400 600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <!-- 尺寸標註線 -->
        <line x1="50" y1="50" x2="350" y2="50" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.5" marker-start="url(#arrow)" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
        <text x="200" y="40" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#333">W: 75 mm</text>

        <line x1="30" y1="80" x2="30" y2="520" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.5" marker-start="url(#arrow)" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
        <text x="20" y="300" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#333" transform="rotate(-90 20,300)">H: 110 mm</text>

        <!-- 箭頭樣式定義 -->
        <defs>
            <marker id="arrow" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="5" refY="5" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#333" />
            </marker>
        </defs>

        <!-- 刀模線 (Die-cut line - 桃紅虛線) -->
        <path d="M 150 80 Q 200 60 250 80 Q 280 120 300 200 Q 320 250 320 300 Q 330 350 350 400 Q 360 480 320 520 L 100 520 Q 50 480 60 400 Q 80 350 90 300 Q 90 250 110 200 Q 130 120 150 80 Z" fill="none" stroke="#FF007F" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="8,6" />

        <!-- 安全範圍 (Safe Margin - 青色虛線) -->
        <path d="M 155 95 Q 200 75 245 95 Q 270 130 290 205 Q 310 250 310 300 Q 320 345 335 395 Q 345 470 310 505 L 115 505 Q 70 470 75 395 Q 95 345 100 300 Q 100 250 120 205 Q 140 130 155 95 Z" fill="#1b4f72" stroke="#00FFFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5,5" />

        <!-- Q版太子爺純色向量示意 (Vector Silhouette) -->
        <!-- 頭部與髮冠 -->
        <circle cx="200" cy="220" r="50" fill="#fdebd0" />
        <path d="M 160 170 Q 200 130 240 170" fill="none" stroke="#17202a" stroke-width="25" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <circle cx="200" cy="130" r="20" fill="#c0392b" />
        <circle cx="140" cy="180" r="15" fill="#c0392b" />
        <circle cx="260" cy="180" r="15" fill="#c0392b" />

        <!-- 五官 -->
        <circle cx="180" cy="220" r="8" fill="#17202a" />
        <circle cx="220" cy="220" r="8" fill="#17202a" />
        <path d="M 190 240 Q 200 250 210 240" fill="none" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />

        <!-- 身體與盔甲 -->
        <path d="M 165 270 L 235 270 L 250 400 L 150 400 Z" fill="#2874a6" stroke="#f1c40f" stroke-width="4"/>
        <rect x="180" y="320" width="40" height="40" fill="#f1c40f" rx="5" />
        
        <!-- 混天綾 (紅綾) -->
        <path d="M 120 250 Q 80 320 160 380 Q 200 400 240 380 Q 320 320 280 250" fill="none" stroke="#e74c3c" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round" />

        <!-- 火尖槍 -->
        <line x1="280" y1="180" x2="250" y2="450" stroke="#f1c40f" stroke-width="6" />
        <polygon points="280,140 270,180 290,180" fill="#e67e22" />

        <!-- 風火輪 -->
        <circle cx="170" cy="430" r="15" fill="#e74c3c" stroke="#f1c40f" stroke-width="3" />
        <circle cx="230" cy="430" r="15" fill="#e74c3c" stroke="#f1c40f" stroke-width="3" />

        <!-- 文字排版區域 (金線刺繡色) -->
        <text x="315" y="220" font-size="22" font-weight="bold" fill="#f1c40f" style="writing-mode: tb; letter-spacing: 5px;">虎尾龍安宮</text>
        <text x="200" y="485" font-size="26" font-weight="bold" fill="#f1c40f" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="2px">2026太子文化祭</text>
        
        <!-- 底部金色祥雲圖騰示意 -->
        <path d="M 100 450 Q 120 430 140 450 T 180 450 T 220 450 T 260 450 T 300 450" fill="none" stroke="#f1c40f" stroke-width="3" opacity="0.4"/>

    </svg>
</div>
</body>
</html>
